  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "The account is stated to pay **2% annual interest**. The deposit amounts and schedule affect how much interest Jane earns, but not the account’s interest rate.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\% \\text{ per year}}\n\\]",
    "The change in Jane’s weekly savings does not affect the account’s interest rate. The problem states that the account pays **2% annual interest**, compounded once at the end of each year.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\% \\text{ per year}}\n\\]",
    "Even with the correction that Jane will continue saving **$4 each week**, the account’s interest rate remains the rate given in the problem: **2% annually**, compounded once per year.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\% \\text{ per year}}\n\\]",
